Label < UILabel
  font: verdana-11px-antialised
  color: #dfdfdf

  $disabled:
    color: #dfdfdf88

FlatLabel < UILabel
  font: verdana-11px-antialised
  color: #dfdfdf
  size: 86 20
  text-offset: 3 3
  image-source: /images/ui/panel_flat
  image-border: 1

  $disabled:
    color: #dfdfdf88

MenuLabel < Label

